## Permitted use

If you have been invited to take part in a Factory interview, you are granted a
limited, non-exclusive, revocable license, for the duration of that interview
process, to:

- fork, clone, and copy this repository;
- modify it in any way, including with AI coding agents;
- push your changes to your own fork or your own copy of it; and
- present, demonstrate, screen-share, or record your work for the purpose of
  that interview.

You do not need to request separate written permission for any of the above.

## Not permitted

- Commercial or production use of any kind.
- Redistributing this code, modified or unmodified, as your own work or under
  your own license terms.
- Treating the seeded sample data as real customer data, or loading real
  customer or personal data into the application.

Any use outside the terms above still requires prior written permission from the
repository owner.

